4:14-4:23 error unexpected_token: Unexpected keyword ':ToString' - expected an operator or ';'
4:14-4:23 warning unknown_keyword: Unknown SSL keyword: ':ToString'
7:2-7:7 warning nil_method_call: Variable 'oConn' may be NIL at this point. Calling methods on NIL raises an error.
